OL,3,GNEWSATesco's first supermarket in Skye
OL,4,Acould open in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FTesco could open its first store on the
OL,7,FIsle of Skye by the end of 2028.
OL,9,FDeveloper West Ranga Skye Limited has
OL,10,Fsubmitted a detailed planning
OL,11,Fapplication with Highland Council for a
OL,12,Ffood store and a fuel filling station
OL,13,Fin Portree.
OL,15,FThe proposed site near the town's new
OL,16,Flink road was previously earmarked for
OL,17,Fa supermarket by local authority.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
