OL,3,GNEWSATesco's first supermarket in Skye
OL,4,Acould open in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Ranga Skye Limited said the store
OL,7,Fcould employ about 100 people, and
OL,8,Fconstruction work could start next
OL,9,Fsummer if planning permission was
OL,10,Fsecured.
